 "description": "Solis-perez2019 - A fractional mathematical model of breast cancer competition model\nBioModels BIOMD0000000903 (curated). SBML file: Solis-perez2019.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 30 time units (SED-ML: Solis-perez2019.sedml), sampling 0.03.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 4.28e-06 of species peak (worst: I)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] Decrase_of_healthy_cell_due_to_cancer term 2/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): T1 = T; E1 = E",
